{
  "_comment": "Shared by client/core/test/providers.test.ts and server/internal/provider/template_test.go, so the two implementations of the template grammar cannot drift. Inputs are already-parsed URL parts (pathname, search), not whole URLs: URL parsing differs between a browser and Go at the edges, the grammar must not.",
